{"4142710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gate", "steam_appid": 4142710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2040, rifts in spacetime known as “Gates” appear worldwide. At first, those who entered out of curiosity simply never returned—but after a massive explosion, aberrant entities began consuming cities. In response, nations formed joint response units centered on “Awakened” individuals, and the player is selected as their operator. The mission: enter each Gate, destroy its core to seal the distortion, and eliminate any remaining threats. As the seasons progress, analysis of Core Gems and mission logs accumulates clues about the forces behind the Gates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Key Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player (Operator): The user’s avatar. In the tutorial, you start with a “Basic Weapon / Basic Armor / Basic Skill” loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Main Items (List &amp; Combination System) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A. Weapons – Pistols, rifles, submachine guns, swords, blunt weapons, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B. Armor &amp; Accessories – Currently unavailable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C. Consumables / Utilities – None available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Game Controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: W / A / S / D </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Space Sprint: Left Shift (hold option) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload: R Fire: Left Mouse Button </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Esc </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick Up: E </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Mission Objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate 1 – Eliminate all zombies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate 2 – Eliminate all zombies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate 3 – Survive for 10 minutes and escape.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Stroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2040, rifts in spacetime known as “Gates” appear worldwide. At first, those who entered out of curiosity simply never returned—but after a massive explosion, aberrant entities began consuming cities. In response, nations formed joint response units centered on “Awakened” individuals, and the player is selected as their operator. The mission: enter each Gate, destroy its core to seal the distortion, and eliminate any remaining threats. As the seasons progress, analysis of Core Gems and mission logs accumulates clues about the forces behind the Gates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Key Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Player (Operator): The user’s avatar. In the tutorial, you start with a “Basic Weapon / Basic Armor / Basic Skill” loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Main Items (List &amp; Combination System) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A. Weapons – Pistols, rifles, submachine guns, swords, blunt weapons, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B. Armor &amp; Accessories – Currently unavailable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C. Consumables / Utilities – None available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Game Controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: W / A / S / D </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: Space Sprint: Left Shift (hold option) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload: R Fire: Left Mouse Button </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: Esc </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick Up: E </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Mission Objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate 1 – Eliminate all zombies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate 2 – Eliminate all zombies. </p><